        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A complete AI prompt example includes five components: Role (who the AI is acting as), Context (background, platform, audience, and situation), Task (the exact deliverable to be produced), Format (structure, length, style, and output type), and Constraint (exclusions, required elements, tone rules, and word limits) — each specified explicitly to remove ambiguity from the AI's output. Output quality scales directly with input precision."
