        "name": "What is the difference between a prompt template and a prompt example?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A prompt template is a reusable framework with placeholder variables — for example, 'You are a [role]. Write a [format] about [topic] for [audience]. Keep it under [word count]. Avoid [exclusions].' An AI prompt example is a filled-in, ready-to-use version of that template — specific enough to produce a usable output without modification. Both serve different purposes: templates scale across tasks, examples demonstrate what high-quality output looks like."
