          "text": "The three techniques that produce the fastest improvement in output quality for beginners are: Role Assignment (telling the AI who it should act as before giving the task), Output Format Instructions (specifying exactly how the response should be structured), and Constraint Setting (defining what the AI should NOT include to remove filler and force precision). These three alone can dramatically improve AI output quality within the first week of practice."
